      "instance_name": "racist_metaphor_of_evolution",
      "label": "Racist Metaphor of Evolution",
      "description": "The meme uses a visual metaphor of 'progressive standing' to imply a racial hierarchy, suggesting that Black people are the 'superior' force that 'taught' white people to stand upright. This is a racist distortion of the concept of evolution and progress, implying that racial groups are inherently superior or inferior based on their 'civilizing' influence.",
